<p>Sitam raseeda falak ki sataayi hu'n naana<br />
Zameene karbobala se mai aayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Jale qayaam hui qaid chin gayi chaadar<br />
qadam qadam pa museebat uthaayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Ye waardaate safar muqtasar hai sunleeje<br />
Hussain mar gaye mai lut ke aayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Khuda ki raah me akber se laal ko dekar<br />
mai apni saari bazaa'at lutaayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Mai kya bataau'n jo ummat ne qadr daani ki<br />
rasan ke neel gawaahi me laayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Sitamgaro'n ne rida bhi na rehne di meri<br />
Mai sar ke baalo'n se muh ko chaapayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Mai qatl gaah se soughaat aur kya laati<br />
lahu bhara hua kurta mai laayi hu'n naana</p>

<p>Sa'eed qabre nabi kaampne lagi us dam<br />
Kaha jo binte Ali ne nai aayi hu'n naana<br />
</p>